          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "？ How will you multiply two numbers given in Roman numerals, without converting them to Hindu numerals? Try to find the product of the following pairs of landmark numbers: V × L, L × D, V × D, VII × IX."
            }
          ]
        },
