            0.802,
            0.932
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "2. Consider the extension of the Gumulgal number system beyond 6 in the same way of counting by 2s. Come up with ways of performing the different arithmetic operations "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "( + , - , \\times , \\div )"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " for numbers occurring in this system, without using Hindu numerals. Use this to evaluate the following:"
